{"id": "t164-001", "text": "Caught up with Valentina after work. Her mum has her hip replacement on May 14 and Valentina is staying with her the week after. She sounded pretty anxious about it. Remind me to text her that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-004", "text": "Ivan says the knee op went fine. Discharged the next day, on crutches for six weeks. His wife Lila is doing all the driving now and is knackered. Should pop round with food at some point.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "some point", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-010", "text": "Archie (Arch) has moved into the new place in Glasgow. Says the flat is tiny but the light is amazing. His flatmate Sean plays the drums which is less amazing. Housewarming is Nov 7.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arch", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved into the new place in Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat is tiny", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "light is amazing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "drums", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 7", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t164-011", "text": "Mabel's cat Biscuit had a tooth out yesterday, she was a wreck in the waiting room. All fine now. Mabel is retiring in December too, big leaving do planned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had a tooth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t164-015", "text": "Lwazi's surgery went well, the surgeon said it was textbook. He's home on 4/22 and his partner Alessia has taken the week off. Need to call him a few days after he's home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/22", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taken the week off", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days after he's home", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-017", "text": "Ming mentioned she's been on the waiting list for the cataract op for nearly a year. Finally got a date: Feb 19. She's worried about not being able to read for a while. She loves crime novels, maybe audiobooks would be a good gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly a year"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Feb 19", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about not being able to read", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crime novels", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "audiobooks would be a good gift", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t164-018", "text": "Barbara's husband had a fall last week and broke his wrist. Barbara is managing but sounded tired. Should drop round on Saturday with soup.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke his wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "managing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round on Saturday with soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-020", "text": "Reggie and Ava had their second viewing in Manchester today. They loved the Didsbury one, putting an offer in tomorrow. Ava's mum is helping with the deposit. Don't forget to ask Reggie on Friday whether it was accepted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second viewing in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Reggie on Friday whether it was accepted", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-021", "text": "Mrs Hughes from next door is in for her bypass on December 2nd. Her daughter is coming over from Dublin the day before to look after the dog. Reminder: water her plants while she's in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Hughes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Dublin", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "water her plants", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's in", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-023", "text": "Jack and Oisín are splitting up the flat when the lease ends on 1/31. Jack is going back to his parents in Cork, Oisín is looking at places in Dublin 8. Oisín is stressed about the prices, he's a junior architect and money is tight. I should send him that group chat with room listings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "splitting up the flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when the lease ends", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1/31", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking at places in Dublin 8", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed about the prices", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "junior architect", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "money is tight", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that group chat with room listings", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t164-024", "text": "Grocery run tonight. Need oat milk, bin bags, batteries for the smoke alarm.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Grocery run", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-025", "text": "Talked to Arturo for ages. His mum had a stroke on the 3rd and is in the rehab ward. He's been driving up to Preston every weekend and it's wearing him down. His brother Luca is no help apparently. Must call him Sunday evening to see how he's holding up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the rehab ward", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wearing him down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him Sunday evening to see how he's holding up", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-028", "text": "Sean's off to Berlin for six months from April. Sublet sorted, job at a games studio. He's nervous about the language. Remind me to send him the Duolingo invite before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at a games studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the language", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him the Duolingo invite", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-032", "text": "Idris's dad has his cataract surgery on 11/4 and Idris is driving him. They're getting lunch nearby afterwards so his dad doesn't sit in a waiting room all day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Idris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Idris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "all day"}]}
{"id": "t164-033", "text": "Lila says Ivan is driving her mad on the crutches, refuses to rest. She's taking him to physio twice a week. Their daughter Barbara is home from uni the week after to help out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "driving her mad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the crutches", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home from uni", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t164-034", "text": "Viewing at 6 on Elm Road. Bring passport and payslips. Check the water pressure this time.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Viewing", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring passport and payslips", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check the water pressure", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this time", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t164-035", "text": "Valentina's mum is out of hospital, went home two days after the op. Valentina's staying with her till the end of May. She mentioned she's behind on her thesis and panicking a bit. Should check in with her next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two days after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the end of May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "behind on her thesis", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-038", "text": "Blessing's op went well, home the same evening. Idris says she's sore but cheerful. Remind me to message her on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Idris", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cheerful", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-040", "text": "Michael is having his wisdom teeth out on the 15th. Eva is planning to look after him for the weekend afterwards and has bought a ridiculous amount of jelly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having his wisdom teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look after him", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t164-042", "text": "Aiko got the harbour flat! Moving in on September 28th. Rory's still in Leeds until late October. She wants help with the IKEA furniture that first weekend. I said yes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the harbour flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 28th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until late October"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that first weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t164-043", "text": "Long catch-up with Alessia over coffee. Lwazi's recovering well, walking to the corner shop now. She's going back to work on Monday at the hospital pharmacy and feels guilty about it. Their dog Pepper has been glued to him. I need to ask her how the first day back went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovering", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the hospital pharmacy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "guilty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how the first day back went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t164-044", "text": "Can't believe it's already the last week in the flat. Skip collection on Tuesday, deep clean Wednesday, keys back Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last week in the flat"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Skip collection", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "deep clean", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keys back", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t164-047", "text": "Archie's housewarming is off, his landlord is doing the bathroom that weekend. Moving it to the new year probably.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the new year", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t164-048", "text": "Michael rang about Eva. She's got a minor op on her shoulder on 8/14 and is really nervous because she's never been under general before. He's taking the week off. Her sister Valentina is coming down to stay too. Remind me to text Eva good luck the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "minor op on her shoulder", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down to stay", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Eva good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t164-049", "text": "Jack's moved back to Cork and starts at the hospital in Cork University on Monday as a porter. Says it's a stopgap. Should message him to see how the first week went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back to Cork", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hospital in Cork University", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "porter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him to see how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t164-052", "text": "Abebe's farewell drinks are on Feb 27, the night before he flies. His team is doing a whip round. I should chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "farewell drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Feb 27", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before he flies", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "team", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t164-053", "text": "Oisín found a room in Stoneybatter, moving on the 2nd. His new flatmate is a nurse who works nights so it'll be quiet. Feeling a lot better about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "found a room in Stoneybatter", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse who works nights", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t164-055", "text": "Rory said the scan was clear. Big relief. He's celebrating with Aiko in Bristol that weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t164-056", "text": "Coffee with Alejandro. His partner Uma's sister is expecting twins in January. He also says the restaurant is moving to a bigger site across town, opening date April 1st. Ask him how the opening goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "opening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 1st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the opening goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t164-059", "text": "Reggie's knee is playing up again, physio appointment on the 12th. He thinks he'll need an op eventually. Ava says he's in denial.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is playing up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "eventually"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in denial", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
